# Answer 12 · The Multidisciplinary Nature of Gender Studies (CSS 2022)
@py question 2022-2

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note "In detail": define precisely, explain why, then one heading per discipline with a thinker and a Pakistani example.
@ask DISCUSS IN DETAIL the MULTIDISCIPLINARY NATURE of Gender Studies
(1) Introduction: define GS; multi vs inter vs trans; thesis
(2) Why multidisciplinary: gender everywhere; complex problems; origins
(3) Sociology: Oakley; socialisation
(4) Anthropology: Mead; Ortner; Rosaldo
(5) Psychology: Bem; Gilligan
(6) History: Lerner; her-story
(7) Economics: Boserup; Waring; care
(8) Political science and law: Pateman; MacKinnon; CEDAW
(9) Biology and medicine: sex; intersex; health
(10) Literature, language, media: Showalter; Lakoff; Mulvey
(11) Development and religious studies: Moser; Wadud
